/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 99 0 R
/T (Students seeking financial assistance for higher education face difficulty finding suitable scholarships because information is scattered across multiple websites and portals. They must manually search different platforms and check varying eligibility criteria, which is time-consuming and inefficient. As a result, students may miss suitable scholarship opportunities and important application deadlines. Therefore, there is a need for a centralized and personalized system that simplifies scholarship discovery, eligibility checking, and recommendation.)
/E (Students seeking financial assistance for higher education face difficulty finding suitable scholarships because information is scattered across multiple websites and portals. They must manually search different platforms and check varying eligibility criteria, which is time-consuming and inefficient. As a result, students may miss suitable scholarship opportunities and important application deadlines. Therefore, there is a need for a centralized and personalized system that simplifies scholarship discovery, eligibility checking, and recommendation.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [3]
